-Requires three (3) years of experience in the position offered or three (3) years as an Associate, Data Engineer, Data Analyst, or a related occupation.
-Requires three (3) years of experience with the following skills:
- Technology product and delivery management functions;
- Informatica;
- Oracle (SQL/PL SQL) 10g/11g;
- IBM UDB DB2;
- IBM DB2 for z/OS;
- SQL SERVER;
- Unix;
- Python;
- DB2;
- Cobol;
- JCL;
- Product management and data-driven analysis in agile environments;
- coordinating software development solutions to meet business requirements;
- serving as primary project status contact for business and technology stakeholders;
- cross-functional collaboration; and
delivering high quality technical user interfaces.

